    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but if i take the sumatriptan and it works, doesn't that basically prove it was just a migraine? like, if the pain goes away, it means it wasn't something serious like a stroke or a bleed, right? it just seems like a good way to test it before i waste all that money on an er visit.",
